<title>UK: GECC sets 225 million mark Dec 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 225 million mark Dec 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    225 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    31.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.3125  PAY DATE    28.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	-1 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.3125    PRAECIP     NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND TOBL 99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
